'''Swirlix''' (Japanese: '''ペロッパフ''' ''Peroppafu'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

